<section class="hn hn-preferences">
  <header><span class="hn-overline">HOLO<span class="hn-accent">NEWS</span> / APARÊNCIA</span><h1>Seu jeito de ler.</h1><p>Estas escolhas são só suas. Mestres e jogadores podem usar estilos diferentes.</p></header>
  <form>
    <fieldset class="hn-theme-choices"><legend>Estilo do portal</legend>{{#each themes}}<button type="button" data-theme-choice="{{id}}" aria-pressed="{{selected}}"><span class="hn-theme-swatch" data-swatch="{{id}}" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{detail}}</small></button>{{/each}}</fieldset>
    <label class="hn-preference-field">Tamanho do texto <output data-scale-percent>{{scalePercent}}%</output><input name="fontScale" type="range" min="0.9" max="1.4" step="0.05" value="{{fontScale}}"></label>
    <div class="hn-preference-pair"><label class="hn-preference-field">Espaçamento<select name="density"><option value="comfortable" {{hnSelected density "comfortable"}}>Confortável</option><option value="compact" {{hnSelected density "compact"}}>Compacto</option></select></label><label class="hn-preference-field">Movimento<select name="motionStyle"><option value="full" {{hnSelected motionStyle "full"}}>Completo</option><option value="subtle" {{hnSelected motionStyle "subtle"}}>Sutil</option><option value="reduced" {{hnSelected motionStyle "reduced"}}>Reduzido</option></select></label></div>
    <p class="hn-preference-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-preference-status>Preferências salvas para você.</p>
  </form>
</section>
